id=dexp_veto_autoarm
name=Hacktivate-CSI DexProtector Veto
version=v1
versionCode=1
author=Hacktivate-CSI
description=[Hacktivate-CSI] Arms the in-kernel dexp_veto SIGKILL-veto at boot (uids.txt), and ships a WebUI for one-tap LIVE arm/disarm, uid-from-package resolve, verbose toggle, and a blocked-kill log. Open it from this module's WebUI button. Requires a Hacktivate-CSI kernel built with CONFIG_DEXP_VETO=y.
